layout: links
link: arXiv, The Promptware Kill Chain | https://arxiv.org/abs/2601.09625
link: arXiv, Invitation Is All You Need | https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.12175
link: Schneier on Security | https://www.schneier.com/blog/archives/2026/02/the-promptware-kill-chain.html
