link: SafeBreach, the Gemini attack | https://www.safebreach.com/blog/invitation-is-all-you-need-hacking-gemini/
link: Embrace The Red, ZombAI | https://embracethered.com/blog/posts/2025/spaiware-and-chatgpt-command-and-control-via-prompt-injection-zombai/
